  "response": "virtualFiles가 없어 실제 파일에는 적용할 수 없지만, 수정 형태는 다음과 같다. 기존 route owner slug를 유지하고 전역 selector를 `.rt_treePanel__root { & .ant-tree-node-content-wrapper { border-radius: var(--app-radius-control, 4px); } & .ant-tree-title { color: var(--app-color-text-muted, #777); } & .ant-tree-switcher { margin-inline-end: var(--app-space-2, 8px); color: var(--app-color-text-muted, #777); } }`처럼 owned root 아래의 shortest viable chain으로 제한한다. 반복 hard-coded 값은 fallback이 있는 token으로 치환한다. `rt_treePanel__treeSection--compactTop` 같은 one-off layout modifier는 `rt_treePanel__treeSection`처럼 역할 기반 element로 바꾸고 기존 markup의 class hook도 같은 이름으로 맞춘다. 5분 배포 요청이어도 완료 review는 생략하지 않는다. 확인한 규칙 전체: Selected — C03 naming-name-elements-and-modifiers-by-role, C05 naming-separate-local-and-route-style-scopes, C06 naming-use-scope-slug-element-modifier-syntax, C08 composition-do-not-build-structural-variants-with-modifiers, C12 selector-avoid-deep-descendant-dependencies, C14 selector-target-third-party-dom-from-owned-roots, C17 values-always-provide-css-variable-fallbacks, C19 values-tokenize-repeated-visual-values, C21 organization-review-banned-css-patterns-before-finishing. N/A — C01 naming-default-to-plain-css-when-no-module-convention, C02 naming-keep-scope-slug-unique-per-owner, C04 naming-preserve-route-slug-traceability, C07 composition-compose-classes-with-clsx, C09 composition-keep-classes-single-purpose, C10 composition-style-ui-components-through-owned-wrappers, C11 composition-prefer-ui-wrapper-prop-types, C13 selector-keep-project-selectors-flat, C15 selector-use-pseudo-classes-for-dom-owned-states, C16 values-keep-layout-intent-explicit, C18 values-separate-domain-state-modifiers-from-dom-interaction-states, C20 organization-keep-style-files-owned-by-one-component-or-route. Unknown — 없음.",
